// DailyQuestsData.swift
// Paar-Tagesquest pool — 203 small, doable-today couple missions (DE/EN),
// each finishable in under fifteen minutes (gratitude, touch, listening,
// surprise, digital-detox, micro-dates, async/shift-friendly). The day's
// 3 quests are three consecutive positions of the couple's stable cycle
// (see DailyQuestsLogic.swift), so both partners always see the same set
// and every card rests ~67 days before it can return.
//
// Editorial rules: physical quests are OFFERS, never demands (opt-in
// framing, varied wording); `energy: .quick` marks quests that fit into a
// couple of exhausted minutes.

